Umbrel Push (web)

The interface in web/ adapts material from the umbrelOS web interface:
  https://github.com/getumbrel/umbrel  (packages/ui, read at commit 11e7f5b, 2026-09-22)
  License: PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0
           https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0

Adapted, with changes, from that project:
  - the design tokens in tailwind.config.ts (radii, type sizes, tracking, shadows, colours), in web/src/index.css
  - the surface recipes in index.css (umbrel-material, window glass and chrome, settings-edge-material, settings list
    group and icon tiles), in web/src/index.css
  - the class strings and structure of the button, segmented control and filter pills, search field, input, dialog,
    settings list row and settings summary, in web/src/components/ and web/src/screens/Installed.tsx
  - the layout of the Settings page and the sheet window (layouts/sheet.tsx)

Not taken: umbrelOS logos, wordmarks, icons, app artwork and wallpapers. public/wallpaper.svg and public/icon.svg are
original to this project. The glass lens (WebGL and SVG refraction), the dock and the sheet animations are not included.

